# Paths Semgrep never scans (contrib/semgrep/README.md). Semgrep scans git-tracked files only; this file
# replaces its built-in ignore list, so the usual build and vendor directories are named here too.
# Third-party code kept byte-for-byte from upstream: its findings are upstream's to fix.
#   nlohmann/json single header and Nayuki's QR Code generator.
src/3rdparty/
#   itay-grudev/SingleApplication (MIT), vendored as upstream zec-qt-wallet did.
singleapplication/
# Qt-generated code (uic ui_*.h, moc_*.cpp, qrc_*.cpp) and translations are build output, never
# tracked; named so a local scan of a dirty tree skips them too.
ui_*.h
moc_*.cpp
qrc_*.cpp
*.qm
# The scanner's own rules, test inputs and ledgers.
contrib/semgrep/
# Build output and caches.
build/
bin/
release/
debug/
__pycache__/
node_modules/
*.min.js
